1
00:00:00,838 --> 00:00:02,408
(Sheldon:)And Pythagoras had

2
00:00:02,406 --> 00:00:04,076
(Sheldon:)an irrational fear of beans.

3
00:00:04,075 --> 00:00:06,445
(Sheldon:)Tesla fell madly in love
with a pigeon

4
00:00:06,444 --> 00:00:09,574
(Sheldon:)who he claimed loved him back.

5
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:12,720
(Penny:)Maybe he just had bread
in his pocket.

6
00:00:14,051 --> 00:00:15,981
(Sheldon:)The list extends
outside of science.

7
00:00:15,987 --> 00:00:18,957
(Sheldon:)Painters like Van Gogh
and Pollock,

8
00:00:18,956 --> 00:00:20,826
(Sheldon:)chess champion Bobby Fischer,

9
00:00:20,825 --> 00:00:23,795
(Sheldon:)Brian Wilson of the Beach Boy...

10
00:00:23,794 --> 00:00:27,264
(upbeat pop melody playing)

11
00:00:27,265 --> 00:00:30,195
♪ ...Know if words could say ♪

12
00:00:30,201 --> 00:00:34,701
♪ But darlin',
I'll find a way... ♪

13
00:00:34,705 --> 00:00:36,235
I remember the song!

14
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,110
(Sheldon:)It's called
"Darlin'" by the Beach Boys!

15
00:00:38,109 --> 00:00:39,609
Oh, thank goodness!

16
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:42,010
I'm not crazy!

17
00:00:42,013 --> 00:00:44,683
(Sheldon:)I don't have
to take a pigeon as my bride!

18
00:00:46,984 --> 00:00:50,254
(Leonard:)There goes our shot at
him living on the roof.

19
00:00:52,456 --> 00:00:55,656
(Raj:)So, all right, there he is.

20
00:00:56,494 --> 00:00:58,664
(Raj:)So, should we
introduce ourselves?

21
00:00:58,663 --> 00:01:01,233
No! Let him spot us.

